Abstract = {Living conditions and housing provisions are related to human right
   guarantees and human resource preservation and development, which have
   an impact not only on the standard of living but also on predetermining
   economic, social, and demographic consequences. In countries with a
   transition economy, including Lithuania, the process of housing
   provision has influences on the deepening of social and economic
   problems. The purpose of the research reported in this paper was to
   establish the pattern of regional development and well-being in
   Lithuania, estimate the main factors, and quantify the real estate price
   relationship with a number of social-economic indicators.},
