   energy efficiency reform of existing residential building in Wuhan, the
   energy comsumption of typical existing buildings is calculated using the
   Dest-h energy consumption simulation software before and after energy
   conservation transformation. The energy saving potential of exterior
   window transformation is analyzed and the economy of multiple solutions
