   Streur, Courtney S.; Schafer, Christine L.; Garcia, Valerie P.; Wittmann, Daniela A., Univ Michigan, Dept Urol, Ann Arbor, MI 48109 USA.
   Quint, Elisabeth H., Univ Michigan, Dept Obstet \& Gynecol, Ann Arbor, MI 48109 USA.
   Sandberg, David E., Univ Michigan, Dept Pediat \& Communicable Dis, Ann Arbor, MI 48109 USA.
   Kalpakjian, Claire Z., Univ Michigan, Dept Phys Med \& Rehabil, Ann Arbor, MI 48109 USA.},
