Note = {2nd International Conference on Risk Analysis and Crisis Response,
   Peking Univ, Beijing, PEOPLES R CHINA, OCT 19-21, 2009},
Organization = {Soc Risk Anal Europe; Soc Risk Anal Europe; Soc Risk Anal Japan; China
   Assoc Disaster Prevent, Risk Anal Council},
Abstract = {Grassland snow disaster is one of natural disasters with abruptness and
   severe damage, has greatly affected economic development and society
   stability in the grassland region, so it is important to assess the risk
   of grassland snow disaster with scientific method. In terms of grid GIS
   and natural disaster risk analysis rules, the risk of grassland snow
   disaster in Xilinguole is quantificationally assessed. The results show
   that the risk of grassland snow disaster gradually decreasing from the
   southeast to the northwest in Xilinguole League of Inner Mongolia and
   there are also differences in every county.},
