   Assoc Disaster Prevent, Risk Anal Council},
Abstract = {The Middle and Lower Second Songhua River Basin was chosen as study
   area. From the viewpoint of disaster risk: (1) the assessment index
   system of hazard, exposure, vulnerability, emergency response and
   recovery capability was formulated by using cause analysis; (2) the
   model of risk assessment was put forward by using weighted analysis; (3)
   the information of community and farmland was extracted from RS data and
   land use map;(4) the bottom-up risk assessment was carried out through
   spatializing social and economic data.
   This study can be expected to provide the basis for developing
   strategies to mitigate Flood Disaster and reducing the losses, and to
   ensure the sustainable development of society and economy.},
