Abstract = {Based on the basic geographic data and social-economic data of Xilingol
   League, an optimized layout model for the spatial distribution of
   grassland fire disaster rescuing materials warehouse was established by
   using GIS technique, spatial analysis, suitability analysis model and
   service area analysis model. Analytical Hierarchy Process (AHP) was used
   to decide selecting location factors of grassland fire disaster rescuing
   material warehouse in this paper. On the basis of these models and the
   actual situation of Xilingol League as well as a lot of tests and
   analysis, an optimized layout of rescuing materials warehouse of
   grassland fire disaster was presented, which includes 26 2-hour-reached
   rescuing materials warehouses of grassland fire disaster. The study will
   (1) provide decision-making foundation for grassland fire disaster risk
   management in Xilingol League, (2) help to improve the situation of fire
   disaster, (3) provide reference for governmental authorities on
