Abstract = {A metropolitan area is a region with one or more central cities and a
   tendency gathering the neighboring connected cities as an entirety. The
   metropolitan area of Ruijin city consists of four cities, that is,
   Ruijin, Ningdu, Huichang and Shicheng cities. The fundamental conditions
